WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:19.696
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.696 --> 00:00:27.111
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:30.297
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:34.524
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.524 --> 00:00:40.194
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.194 --> 00:00:45.681
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.681 --> 00:00:51.419
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.419 --> 00:00:57.311
Open the Export tab.

9
00:00:57.311 --> 00:01:04.113
Every month of attendance is saved as a spreadsheet, automatically.

10
00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:09.107
This month’s is already on the iPad.

11
00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:17.527
For earlier months, tap Save All Months to This iPad.

12
00:01:17.527 --> 00:01:23.789
Tap a month to open it.

13
00:01:23.789 --> 00:01:31.275
Attendees down the side, days across — In and Out under each day.

14
00:01:31.275 --> 00:01:37.683
Share sends it on. Tap it.

15
00:01:37.683 --> 00:01:48.001
AirDrop, Mail — or Save to Files, for Numbers or Excel.

16
00:01:48.001 --> 00:01:55.467
There it is, in Files, ready to open or attach.
